Package: torlek
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), git, curl, tmux (>= 3.6)
Suggests: systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Androlax2/agent-cockpit
Description: agent session cockpit: CLI, terminal UI and per-user daemon
 Torlek runs coding agents in terminal sessions and keeps their work,
 questions and approvals together. One installation belongs to one person,
 with a CLI and terminal UI backed by a per-user daemon and tmux.
 .
 This package repackages the published release archive unchanged under
 /usr/lib/torlek. It enables torlek-engine-masks.socket, the root socket of
 Torlek's masks helper, which runs the helper for each connection only.
 User services are written per user by `torlek daemon install`.
